OL,3,GNEWSAHomes and golf club without power
OL,4,Aafter workshop fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of residents woke up to a
OL,7,Fpower cut after fire damaged overhead
OL,8,Fpower cables.
OL,10,FFire crews were called to Burton Road,
OL,11,Fnear Bridport, Dorset, shortly after
OL,12,F05:00 BST, where a private workshop was
OL,13,Falight.
OL,15,FAt 10:00, National Grid said power had
OL,16,Fbeen restored to 401 properties. The
OL,17,Fremaining 20 properties were
OL,18,Freconnected by 13:00.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
