OL,3,GNEWSAHomes and golf club without power
OL,4,Aafter workshop fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those without power was Bridport
OL,7,Fand West Dorset Golf Club, which said
OL,8,Fit would remain closed for the rest of
OL,9,Fthe day.
